  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### Fixed\n\n- Reading STEP reports progress, and can be cancelled, while it translates every representation that the shape of a product relates and every representation a mapped item places: OCCT 8.0.1 is built with a fix of `STEPControl_ActorRead` (an overlay port, until OCCT has it), which gave the second and later of them no progress range. A CATIA V6 hybrid model translated its solids for 11 s without either.",
